00:04:46.063 --> 00:04:50.863
A dopamine pathway from the gut teaches the brain to prefer flavors that start out unpleasant,

00:04:51.463 --> 00:04:53.343
in findings covered by science daily.

00:04:53.923 --> 00:04:58.783
Researchers identified that gut to brain dopamine signaling root as the teacher for the craving.

00:04:59.403 --> 00:05:04.163
The mechanism helps explain why bitter coffee and similar tastes become preferred over time.

00:05:04.763 --> 00:05:07.803
The discovery points to new ways of reshaping eating habits.

