00:05:21.563 --> 00:05:24.703
An international team studied those tree-rich systems in Peru.

00:05:25.503 --> 00:05:29.283
Birds and bats provided natural pest control that boosted cacao production.

00:05:29.963 --> 00:05:32.983
Tree-rich landscapes nearly doubled cacao yields there.

00:05:32.983 --> 00:05:38.623
Televive University researchers examined objects at early human sites for a pattern of keeping

00:05:38.623 --> 00:05:39.683
