00:05:40.263 --> 00:05:43.143
The site's date to roughly 500,000 years ago.

00:05:43.643 --> 00:05:47.943
The pattern suggests early humans picked up and kept ordinary items as reminders of

00:05:47.943 --> 00:05:49.403
